https://t.co/X7ipfsWjp2 condemns the blocking of Bitchat in India. According to @Apple's App Review notice, Bitchat has been blocked under Section 69A of the IT Act read with the Blocking Rules 2009. 

@jack’s post on @X suggests that the developers were neither heard nor served with a blocking order before the application was blocked. He learned of the block only through Apple’s notice, which is all he was able to share.

https://t.co/X7ipfsWjp2 strongly urges the government to withdraw its orders directing Apple, @Google and internet service providers to block the Bitchat application, as such orders are unconstitutional and violate citizens’ rights under Articles 14, 19 and 21 of the Constitution.

Read more about https://t.co/X7ipfsWjp2's statement on the blocking of Bitchat in India here: https://t.co/LRVwN9TiAz

